DESCRIPTION:A great way to find out what it's like to sing in the Duke Cha
 pel is to attend this open rehearsal. This is a relaxed time to sing and 
 meet the students\, faculty\, staff\, and community members in the choir.
  Rehearsals are held in Duke Chapel and music is provided.
DURATION:PT1H
